>
>     My Valk, Brunhilda, has had a particularly good run of luck so far.
> After an initial bad start where a scroll of charging was wasted,
> Brunhilda came across a low level throne room.  After clearing the
> throne room of its occupants, Brunhilda genocided Master Mind
> Flayers and was able to wish for an item.  Brunhilda wished for
